WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.820
In the spring of the year 353, at the Orchid Pavilion the bamboo groves were lush, the stream was clear, and the scenery was like a painting.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:16.920
The great calligrapher Wang Xizhi invited forty-one scholars to hold an elegant gathering here.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:26.220
Everyone sat beside the winding stream; whoever a floating wine cup drifted in front of would drink wine and compose a poem.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:32.880
The scholars chatted and laughed merrily, their poetic inspiration flowing, and they spent a delightful day.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:41.100
Wang Xizhi gathered everyone's poems into a collection, picked up his brush, and with full concentration wrote a preface.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:49.260
This Preface to the Orchid Pavilion Collection, with its beautiful, flowing brushwork, was praised by later generations as the finest running script under heaven.

